      "title": "Use of Proceeds",
      "excerpt": "Anchor USE OF PROCEEDS We will not receive any proceeds from the sale of shares of our common stock by the selling stockholders identified in this prospectus. However, we will receive proceeds from the exercise of the Warrants for cash. We expect to use these proceeds for working capital purposes. We will have broad discretion over the use of proceeds from the exercise of the Warrants. There is no assurance that the holders of the Warrants will elect to exercise any or all of such Warrants. The Warrants contain a \u201ccashless exercise\u201d feature that allows the holders to exercise any of such Warrants without making a cash payment to us if there is not an effective registration statement covering the resale of the shares issuable upon exercise of such Warrants. 8 End Page 11 Begin Page 12 Anchor TABLE OF CONTENTS Anchor SELLING STOCKHOLDERS This prospectus relates to the sale from time to tim",
